  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, then (where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is a constant of integration)",
