  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>81</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>54</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>54</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>54</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is the constant of integration.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>54</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>54</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>54</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>",
